1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,060
Man: Hey Susan, are you planning to hit the gym later today?

2
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:10,240
Woman: I am. But only after I wrap up the quarterly report.

3
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:16,160
It's taking longer than expected, so I'll probably head over in the evening. I usually go earlier.

4
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:19,040
Man: I've been thinking about getting back into a routine myself.

5
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:23,080
It's been weeks since I last worked out. I could use a bit of motivation.

6
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:26,602
Woman: Well, if you're up for it, we could do a session together.

7
00:00:26,602 --> 00:00:29,040
I was planning to focus on strength training today.

8
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:31,120
Man: That sounds like a good idea.
